{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Year is 2069, you find yourself in <strong>Wave City</strong>, a place where Aesthetics have been refined and technology has evolved unchecked. Wave City\u2019s main export is <strong>Colorado Iced Tea</strong>\u00a0which is pumped locally straight out of <strong>Dream Lake. </strong>The people of Wave City reap the benefits of the resulting booming economy and go about their simple lives in bliss...and ignorance. The pollution from the Colorado Iced Tea production has affected the mental state of all the surrounding residents, making them more happy, docile, and apathetic,\u00a0almost as if they are living in a dream 24/7. This has led to widespread corruption throughout the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VAPORPUNK is an open world, first person shooter, with RPG elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is a to traverse the city completing quests to collect money, items, and upgrades while building your reputation to unlock more opportunities. Rise from nothing to something, meeting wacky characters and exploring saturated environments along the way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1589060?t=1771010638","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1589060?t=1771010638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589060/8de76f5a9df1d1f8686674ba5d746be3191490b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771010638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589060/8de76f5a9df1d1f8686674ba5d746be3191490b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771010638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Contains stylized acts of violence, sci-fi laser weapons, use of vaporizers, implied psychedelic influence, nudity in the form of marble sculptures, and witnessing of crimes such as robbery and intimidation."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Year is 2069, you find yourself in <strong>Wave City</strong>, a place where Aesthetics have been refined and technology has evolved unchecked. Wave City\u2019s main export is <strong>Colorado Iced Tea</strong>\u00a0which is pumped locally straight out of <strong>Dream Lake. </strong>The people of Wave City reap the benefits of the resulting booming economy and go about their simple lives in bliss...and ignorance. The pollution from the Colorado Iced Tea production has affected the mental state of all the surrounding residents, making them more happy, docile, and apathetic,\u00a0almost as if they are living in a dream 24/7. This has led to widespread corruption throughout the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VAPORPUNK is an open world, first person shooter, with RPG elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is a to traverse the city completing quests to collect money, items, and upgrades while building your reputation to unlock more opportunities. Rise from nothing to something, meeting wacky characters and exploring saturated environments along the way.</p>","developers":["Aesthetic Realities"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589060/header.jpg?t=1771010638","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tra